{"words": [{"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "ٱدْعُ", "translation": "Pray"}, {"text": "لَنَا", "translation": "for us"}, {"text": "رَبَّكَ", "translation": "(to) your Lord"}, {"text": "يُبَيِّن", "translation": "to make clear"}, {"text": "لَّنَا", "translation": "to us"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "هِىَ ۚ", "translation": "it (is)"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translation": "Indeed, He"}, {"text": "يَقُولُ", "translation": "says"}, {"text": "إِنَّهَا", "translation": "[Indeed] it"}, {"text": "بَقَرَةٌۭ", "translation": "(is) a cow"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "فَارِضٌۭ", "translation": "old"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "بِكْرٌ", "translation": "young"}, {"text": "عَوَانٌۢ", "translation": "middle aged"}, {"text": "بَيْنَ", "translation": "between"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ ۖ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "فَٱفْعَلُوا۟", "translation": "so do"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "تُؤْمَرُونَ", "translation": "you are commanded"}], "sahih": "They said, \"Call upon your Lord to make clear to us what it is.\" [Moses] said, \"[Allāh] says, 'It is a cow which is neither old nor virgin, but median between that,' so do what you are commanded.\""}